    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/flight-booking/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Flight Booking is a comprehensive, user-friendly theme crafted as a booking system for airlines and travel agencies, making it an ideal platform for travel companies and global service providers. This responsive solution caters to various needs, from travel booking agencies to flight reservation systems, and encompasses features for handling flight itineraries, ticket purchases, and online bookings. It provides a modern Airline Reservation System and Travel Booking Interface, ensuring a seamless user experience for those planning their next trip. With a clean and structured design, users can easily explore destinations, compare options, and complete reservations efficiently. The advanced flight search functionality allows filtering by destination, date, and budget, while its integrated comparison tools facilitate smart decision-making for travelers. Fully responsive across devices, the theme caters to mobile-first users and includes a secure payment gateway for safe transactions. Additionally, it offers real-time flight updates and transport scheduling to enhance travel planning. With strong SEO optimization and customizable layouts, Flight Booking empowers travel agencies and businesses to strengthen their online presence, attract a global clientele, and streamline their booking operations effectively."
    },
